title: Global shell › Sidebar footer › Settings, Help, Sign out, user card
route: Every page (bottom of the sidebar)
intro: The footer has a 'Demo data' tile, three rows (Settings, Help, Sign out) and the user card. Only Settings leaves the page. Help and Sign out answer with a short message, and the tile and the user card are plain labels.
dir: TD
---
start s1 "Look at the bottom of the sidebar"
screen foot "Footer\n'Demo data' tile, 'Settings', 'Help', 'Sign out', then 'JP  Jordan Perez  UR coordinator'"

click cTile "Click the 'Demo data' tile"
process pTile "Nothing happens: it is a label only"
endx eTile "No change"

click cSet "Click 'Settings'"
process pSet "Go to /settings"
process pSetOn "The 'Settings' row turns green while the address starts with /settings\n(the only footer row that highlights)"
goto gSet "Continues in: Settings"

click cHelp "Click 'Help'"
toast tHelp "'Help'\n'Press Ask FLO (top right) to ask a question. Use Demo, top right, to reset or move time forward.'"
process pHelp "No page opens and no dialog: the message is the whole of Help"
decision dHelp "What does the person do next?"
click cAsk "Click 'Ask FLO'"
click cDemo "Click 'Demo'"
goto gAsk "Continues in: Global shell › Top bar › Ask FLO › Ask a question"
goto gDemo "Continues in: Global shell › Demo menu › Open, close and what is inside"

click cOut "Click 'Sign out'"
toast tOut "'This is a demo'\n'There is nothing to sign out of.'"
process pOut "The person stays signed in as Jordan Perez\nThere is no login screen in the demo"
end eOut "Same page, same data"

click cCard "Click the user card\n('JP', 'Jordan Perez', 'UR coordinator')"
process pCard "Nothing happens: no menu, no profile page"
process pWho "Jordan Perez is the person every action is credited to\nThe Case Manager sign dialog says so: 'You are signed in as Jordan Perez, a UR coordinator'"
endx eCard "No change"

process pToast "Toasts fade after about 4 seconds, or on a click"

s1 --> foot
foot --> cTile --> pTile --> eTile
foot --> cSet --> pSet --> pSetOn --> gSet
foot --> cHelp --> tHelp --> pHelp --> dHelp
dHelp -->|Ask a question| cAsk --> gAsk
dHelp -->|Move the clock or reset| cDemo --> gDemo
foot --> cOut --> tOut --> pOut --> eOut
foot --> cCard --> pCard --> eCard
pCard -.-> pWho
tHelp -.-> pToast
tOut -.-> pToast
